OL,3,GNEWSAAbout 280 people evacuated after
OL,4,Afire at seaside hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 280 people have been evacuated
OL,7,Ffrom a seaside hotel after a fire broke
OL,8,Fout overnight.
OL,10,FKent Fire & Rescue Service said that 26
OL,11,Ffire engines were sent to the Grand
OL,12,FBurstin Hotel in Folkestone at about
OL,13,F01:05 BST. In an update at 08:30, it
OL,14,Fsaid that 10 fire engines remained at
OL,15,Fthe scene "dampening down any remaining
OL,16,Fhotspots".
OL,18,FStation manager Lawrence Pater said the
OL,19,F"very severe" fire had raised concerns
OL,20,Fabout the structural integrity of the
OL,21,Fbuilding, and that it was seeking
OL,22,Fadvice from inspectors.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
