OL,3,GNEWSAAbout 280 people evacuated after
OL,4,Afire at seaside hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FFolkestone & Hythe District Council has
OL,7,Fset up a welfare centre at the Three
OL,8,FHills Sports Park and nearby residents
OL,9,Fhave been advised to avoid the area of
OL,10,Fthe fire and close windows and doors.
